      "writtenOn": "2024-01-12T21:00:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IOW: \n```\nstruct IndirectDispatchArgs { int, int, int; };\n\nssboA { IndirectDispatchArgs a, b; } // \u003c-- packs tightly as 3,3\nssboB { uint3 a, b; } // \u003c-- packs as 3+1,3+1\n```\nIs that right?",
      "parentUuid": "dcf1984e_6014f87a",
      "revId": "3232b637fdde0ee84b072fdfc0097606e97e73f5",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
